From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dsi: preserve MSM8226 per-lane PHY configuration

The exact MSM8226 factory DTS specifies per-data-lane CFG4 values
00,05,0a,0f. Active hardware readback shows mainline overwrites all
four with zero. The other eight values in each lane's profile match.

Use the factory lane values under the existing MSM8226 PHY quirk;
leave other 28nm PHY variants unchanged. This is an isolated experiment
for the stalled data path, pending physical output acceptance.

Source: LineageOS android_kernel_samsung_msm8226 at
3fa1853ed5d6c3a8ef5a2fda9822705243bbc256,
arch/arm/boot/dts/msm8226/dsi_panel_tc358764_wxga_video-r01.dtsi
and drivers/video/msm/mdss/msm_mdss_io_8974.c.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/phy/dsi_phy_28nm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/phy/dsi_phy_28nm.c
index e7f021a98..88aece4ec 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/phy/dsi_phy_28nm.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/dsi/phy/dsi_phy_28nm.c
@@ -828,7 +828,8 @@ static int dsi_28nm_phy_enable(struct msm_dsi_phy *phy,
 		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_CFG_1(i));
 		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_CFG_2(i));
 		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_CFG_3(i));
-		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_CFG_4(i));
+		writel((phy->cfg->quirks & DSI_PHY_28NM_QUIRK_PHY_8226) ?
+		       i * 5 : 0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_CFG_4(i));
 		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_TEST_DATAPATH(i));
 		writel(0, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_DEBUG_SEL(i));
 		writel(0x1, base + REG_DSI_28nm_PHY_LN_TEST_STR_0(i));
